// Misprints are two entries of the "least-square + linear" column that
// break the column's linearity in z and whose corrections restore it to
// 2e-5: Table II, second function row, −12.339281 for −12.330283; Table I,
// fourth divided difference, −6.4341227 for −0.64341227 (a slipped decimal
// point). Table II's entry was checked on a high-zoom page image; these
// are inferences from the column's structure, not errata from the journal.
